window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>A Relentless Quest for Revenge. A Blurred Line Between Hero and Villain. </b><br> <br> In the outskirts of the opulent city of Epis Kopol, where terror reigns under the bloodstained rule of the Far Seer Priest, Badu stands as the fiercest warrior of the Nöz, a band of vigilantes devoted to opposing the tyrant. Badu’s skills are unmatched, his resolve unbreakable, but when a ruthless assassin with a vendetta against the Far Seer Priest joins the Nöz, the group is forever changed.<br> <br> Driven by an unquenchable thirst for revenge, Badu finds himself entangled in a perilous journey alongside his new leader. Together, they navigate a dark world of deception and violence, ever planning their boldest attempt yet: the assassination of the Far Seer Priest.<br> <br> When their plan unravels, leading Badu to despair, he finds himself trapped by the fate he sought to escape. Badu's last flicker of hope lies in an ancient legend and a desperate prayer for a miracle.<br> <br> Dive into a story where every turn is darker than the last, and the line between hero and villain blurs in the fight for redemption and survival.<br> <br> (Story and writing are Human Author, certified by The Author's Guild - Certification #1553196)</p>"; 
